; Provetrail sealed run record, v0.1 (SPEC.md Section 8).
;
; The portable record: every event's canonical bytes plus the signed checkpoint
; over the Merkle head they rebuild. The container is closed: exactly these two
; fields, and a record MUST carry at least one event (record.empty).

sealed-run = {
  events: [ + event-bytes ],
  checkpoint: bstr .cbor signed-checkpoint,
}

; Each entry is the canonical encoding of one event (envelope.cddl); a verifier
; rehashes these exact bytes and never re-serializes.
event-bytes = bstr .cbor event
